I'm afraid you have misread it. {na} can only appear in front
of the whole selbri, possibly mixed with tags. It can't appear
inside of a tanru.

You can fix the poem by changing {na mulno} to {narmulno}. In any
case you didn't want na to have scope over more than mulno.

